at collapse in a second impact.\",\"font\":16.799999237060547,\"width\":462.4800109863281,\"height\":62.040000915527344,\"measuredH\":60,\"overflow\":false},{\"cardId\":\"leather-starfish\",\"id\":\"4008:452906\",\"text\":\"WT: ~75g\",\"font\":15.5,\"width\":110,\"height\":27,\"measuredH\":27,\"overflow\":false},{\"cardId\":\"cleaner-shrimp\",\"id\":\"I2906:237313;2055:41785\",\"text\":\"LT: 1.7”\",\"font\":16.920000076293945,\"width\":118.44000244140625,\"height\":25.3799991607666,\"measuredH\":20,\"overflow\":false},{\"cardId\":\"cleaner-shrimp\",\"id\":\"I2906:237313;2055:41787\",\"text\":\"WT: ~2.2g\",\"font\":16.920000076293945,\"width\":121.26000213623047,\"height\":25.3799991607666,\"measuredH\":20,\"overflow\":false},{\"cardId\":\"giant-triton\",\"id\":\"4008:452910\",\"text\":\"Shell: 11.3”\",\"font\":17,\"width\":110,\"height\":27,\"measuredH\":27,\"overflow\":false},{\"cardId\":\"giant-triton\",\"id\":\"4008:452911\",\"text\":\"WT: ~5.7lbs\",\"font\":15.5,\"width\":110,\"height\":27,\"measuredH\":27,\"overflow\":false},{\"cardId\":\"octopus\",\"id\":\"4008:452914\",\"text\":\"Octopodidae\",\"font\":17,\"width\":171,\"height\":27,\"measuredH\":27,\"overflow\":false},{\"cardId\":\"octopus\",\"id\":\"4008:452915\",\"text\":\"Span: 8”\",\"font\":17,\"width\":110,\"height\":27,\"measuredH\":27,\"overflow\":false},{\"cardId\":\"octopus\",\"id\":\"4008:452916\",\"text\":\"WT: 100g\",\"font\":17,\"width\":110,\"height\":27,\"measuredH\":27,\"overflow\":false},{\"cardId\":\"octopus\",\"id\":\"4008:452917\",\"text\":\"Indo-Pacific\",\"font\":17,\"width\":134,\"height\":27,\"measuredH\":27,\"overflow\":false},{\"cardId\":\"octopus\",\"id\":\"I745:145216;213:3170\",\"text\":\"Greater blue-ringed octopuses flash vivid blue rings when threatened. These small reef hunters use potent venom to subdue crabs and other prey.\",\"font\":19,\"width\":545,\"height\":71,\"measuredH\":69,\"overflow\":false},{\"cardId\":\"oysters\",\"id\":\"4008:452920\",\"text\":\"Shell: 2.4”\",\